Name: sacremoses
Short Name: sacremoses
URL: https://github.com/hplt-project/sacremoses
Version: 0.2.0
License: MIT
License File: LICENSE
Security Critical: no
Shipped: yes

Description:
A Python port of the Moses tokenizer and detokenizer. Tark uses its English
detokenizer's rules on IndicTrans2's English output.

Local Modifications:
MosesDetokenizer(lang="en") ported to C++ in
components/tark_captions/indic_text.cc. No Python is shipped.
